      "offset_unit": "unicode_code_point"
    },
    {
      "id": "surrender",
      "section": "chapter-001",
      "block": "b-031a374e9090ba29242f",
      "quote": "九月，公到新野〖7〗，琮遂降。备走夏口〖8〗。",
      "layer": "original",
      "section_title": "武帝纪第一",
      "source": {
        "file": "OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml",
        "index": 663,
        "anchor": null
      },
      "source_sha256": "b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28",
      "note_id": null,
      "start": 39,
      "end": 62,
      "offset_unit": "unicode_code_point"
    },
    {
      "id": "su-meets",
      "section": "chapter-054",
      "block": "b-ecd089e31afbb09dad94",
      "quote": "权即遣肃行。到夏口，闻曹公已向荆州，晨夜兼道。比至南郡，而表子琮已降曹公；备惶遽奔走，欲南渡江。肃径迎之，到当阳长坂〖10〗，与备会。宣腾权旨〖11〗，及陈江东强固，劝备与权并力：备甚欢悦。",
      "layer": "original",
      "section_title": "周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九",
      "source": {
        "file": "OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml",
        "index": 213,
        "anchor": null
      },
      "source_sha256": "b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28",
      "note_id": null,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 95,
      "offset_unit": "unicode_code_point"
    },
    {
      "id": "envoy-shu",
      "section": "chapter-032",
      "block": "b-1846d8225e91af23e064",
      "quote": "先主遣诸葛亮自结于孙权，",
      "layer": "original",
      "section_title": "先主传第二",
      "source": {
        "file": "OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml",
        "index": 113,
        "anchor": null
      },
      "source_sha256": "b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28",
      "note_id": null,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 12,
      "offset_unit": "unicode_code_point"
    },
    {
      "id": "envoy-su",
      "section": "chapter-054",
      "block": "b-47261412a84083cdfce6",
      "quote": "备遂到夏口，遣亮使权。肃亦反命〖13〗。",
      "layer": "original",
      "section_title": "周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九",
      "source": {
        "file": "OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml",
        "index": 214,
        "anchor": null
      },
      "source_sha256": "b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28",
      "note_id": null,
      "start": 31,
      "end": 51,
      "offset_unit": "unicode_code_point"
    },
    {
      "id": "meeting-zhou",
      "section": "chapter-054",
      "block": "b-df9e8a2d1c2855c608f2",
      "quote": "时刘备为曹公所破，欲引南渡江；与鲁肃遇于当阳，遂共图计。因进住夏口，遣诸葛亮诣权。权遂遣瑜及程普等，与备并力逆曹公，遇于赤壁。",
      "layer": "original",
      "section_title": "周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九",
      "source": {
        "file": "OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml",
        "index": 62,
        "anchor": null
      },
      "source_sha256": "b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28",
      "note_id": null,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 63,
      "offset_unit": "unicode_code_point"
    },
    {
      "id": "su-advice",
      "section": "chapter-054",
      "block": "b-472e77c03c5b35774219",
      "quote": "权知其意，执肃手曰：“卿欲何言？”肃对曰：“向察众人之议〖5〗，专欲误将军：不足与图大事。今肃可迎操耳，如将军，不可也。何以言之？今肃迎操，操当以肃还付乡党〖6〗；品其名位，犹不失下曹从事〖7〗，乘犊车〖8〗，从吏卒，交游士林：累官故不失州郡也〖9〗。将军迎操，欲安所归〖10〗？愿早定大计，莫用众人之议也！”",
      "layer": "original",
      "section_title": "周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九",
      "source": {
        "file": "OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml",
        "index": 232,
        "anchor": null
      },
      "source_sha256": "b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28",
      "note_id": null,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 155,
      "offset_unit": "unicode_code_point"
    },
    {
      "id": "su-recall",
      "section": "chapter-054",
      "block": "b-6e5753512f06b6a12b33",
      "quote": "时周瑜受使至鄱阳〖12〗，肃劝追召瑜还。",
      "layer": "original",
      "section_title": "周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九",
